{{Quote|A large katana with a hilt made of white fur, previously carried by a [[Order|career surgeon]].|Item}}
'''Koko''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Koko is not seen much in builds, but it is a really good sword for hybrids. Especially when paired with [[Control]], where it gets heavily buffed, making it a versatile option.

==Obtainment==
Koko can be dropped after defeating [[Order]].

